{"type":"lemma","type_name":"Lemma","number":"18.3.4","title":"A Convex Set Is Solid or Flat","title_html":"A Convex Set Is Solid or Flat","html":"<p>Let <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"V \\ne \\{\\mathbf{0}\\}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D449 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2260\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D7CE TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi><mo>≠</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">0</mn></mrow><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> and let <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"C \\subseteq V\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2286\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D449 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>V</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> be non-empty and convex.\nThen <strong>either</strong> <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"C\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> has\nan interior point, <strong>or</strong> <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"C\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> lies in an affine hyperplane: there are\n<span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{a} \\ne \\mathbf{0}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41A TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2260\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom space=\"4\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D7CE TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">a</mi></mrow><mo>≠</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">0</mn></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> and <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"c \\in \\mathbb{R}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D450 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=